      "document_start": 168,
      "document_end": 188,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 2;",
      "section_id": "section_bd20bb363fa5"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_589cd9e14d2957c697b0",
      "document_start": 189,
      "document_end": 205,
      "text": "3.2.1 流体力学的基本概念;",
      "section_id": "section_bd20bb363fa5"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_e3c1d80a713a50bb577f",
      "document_start": 206,
      "document_end": 238,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_bd20bb363fa5"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_31646ce7089c7da72b30",
      "document_start": 240,
      "document_end": 270,
      "text": "从微观上讲，流体是由大量分子所组成的，其作用和运动十分复杂。",
      "section_id": "section_bd20bb363fa5"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_82db12f343858beac905",
      "document_start": 270,
      "document_end": 325,
      "text": "流体力学通常将实际的、由大量分子所组成的流体抽象为在微观上充分大、在宏观上足够小的流体分子团所组成的连续流体。",
      "section_id": "section_bd20bb363fa5"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_edaa6639cf9100de6c1f",
      "document_start": 325,
      "document_end": 363,
      "text": "流体分子团的运动服从统计规律，而流体分子团在宏观上足够小可以看作一个“点”。",
      "section_id": "section_bd20bb363fa5"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_19147af2675398c05620",
      "document_start": 363,
      "document_end": 399,
      "text": "因此这种流体分子团称为流体质点，它具有温度、密度、压强、速度等宏观参数。",
      "section_id": "section_bd20bb363fa5"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_2e7362ccd2a1247517d0",
      "document_start": 401,
      "document_end": 421,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 3;",
      "section_id": "section_bd20bb363fa5"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_85ba4bfb301d610de331",
      "document_start": 422,
      "document_end": 438,
      "text": "3.2.1 流体力学的基本概念;",
      "section_id": "section_bd20bb363fa5"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_5a37cfe12e3d706708a1",
      "document_start": 439,
      "document_end": 471,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_bd20bb363fa5"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_890036c8873098a425aa",
      "document_start": 473,
      "document_end": 541,
      "text": "从承受载荷能力的角度讲，流体只能承受压应力，不能承受拉应力和剪切应力，任何剪切应力的存在都会使流体发生流动，这也是流体与固体的重要区别。",
      "section_id": "section_bd20bb363fa5"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_006060b22c4a8dc5aafc",
      "document_start": 541,
      "document_end": 589,
      "text": "因此，在流体中，其法向应力只能是压应力，不能是拉应力，这种压应力称为压强，在工程上通常称为压力。",
      "section_id": "section_bd20bb363fa5"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_090c4d8a60c240669e91",
      "document_start": 589,
      "document_end": 628,
      "text": "真实的流体在流动时可以表现出一定的承受剪切应力的能力，这种性质称为流体的黏性。",
      "section_id": "section_bd20bb363fa5"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_5d144b9ee73ebe45ece2",
      "document_start": 628,
      "document_end": 703,
      "text": "流体的黏性只有在流体中的相邻流体质点有相对运动时才表现出来，许多常见的流体(如水、空气等)的黏性都很小，在相对运动速度不大的情况下，其黏性的影响很小。",
      "section_id": "section_bd20bb363fa5"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_ec5a19860a9784c64233",
      "document_start": 703,
      "document_end": 745,
      "text": "在这种情况下，可以完全忽略黏性的影响，以使问题得到简化，忽略黏性的流体称为理想流体。",
      "section_id": "section_bd20bb363fa5"
    }
