        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_890036c8873098a425aa",
          "document_start": 473,
          "document_end": 541,
          "text": "从承受载荷能力的角度讲，流体只能承受压应力，不能承受拉应力和剪切应力，任何剪切应力的存在都会使流体发生流动，这也是流体与固体的重要区别。",
          "section_id": "section_bd20bb363fa5",
          "start": 473,
          "end": 541,
          "chunk_start": 473,
          "chunk_end": 541,
          "sentence_document_start": 473,
          "sentence_document_end": 541,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_006060b22c4a8dc5aafc",
          "document_start": 541,
          "document_end": 589,
          "text": "因此，在流体中，其法向应力只能是压应力，不能是拉应力，这种压应力称为压强，在工程上通常称为压力。",
          "section_id": "section_bd20bb363fa5",
          "start": 541,
          "end": 589,
          "chunk_start": 541,
          "chunk_end": 589,
          "sentence_document_start": 541,
          "sentence_document_end": 589,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_090c4d8a60c240669e91",
          "document_start": 589,
          "document_end": 628,
          "text": "真实的流体在流动时可以表现出一定的承受剪切应力的能力，这种性质称为流体的黏性。",
          "section_id": "section_bd20bb363fa5",
          "start": 589,
          "end": 628,
          "chunk_start": 589,
          "chunk_end": 628,
          "sentence_document_start": 589,
          "sentence_document_end": 628,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_5d144b9ee73ebe45ece2",
          "document_start": 628,
          "document_end": 703,
          "text": "流体的黏性只有在流体中的相邻流体质点有相对运动时才表现出来，许多常见的流体(如水、空气等)的黏性都很小，在相对运动速度不大的情况下，其黏性的影响很小。",
          "section_id": "section_bd20bb363fa5",
          "start": 628,
          "end": 703,
          "chunk_start": 628,
          "chunk_end": 703,
          "sentence_document_start": 628,
          "sentence_document_end": 703,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_ec5a19860a9784c64233",
          "document_start": 703,
          "document_end": 745,
          "text": "在这种情况下，可以完全忽略黏性的影响，以使问题得到简化，忽略黏性的流体称为理想流体。",
          "section_id": "section_bd20bb363fa5",
          "start": 703,
          "end": 745,
          "chunk_start": 703,
          "chunk_end": 745,
          "sentence_document_start": 703,
          "sentence_document_end": 745,
          "sentence_complete": true
        }
      ],
